  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: du shows .archived-transcripts 743MB in 275 dirs (432 .gz), .training-data.jsonl 1.3GB, .deprecated-datasets 484MB, .agent/ 2.9GB total (was 2.2GB). rotate-on-session-end.sh:63 still cites ADR-0018 retention; the only writers are rotation and the crashed-/stray- archivers in launch-transcript-sync.sh, and scrub-transcript-corpus only redacts in place. Premise holds; numbers grew. MECHANISM: append-only transcript archive by design; no pruning path exists."  # 453e
